// walk: move around a room with the keyboard, picking up gold.
//
// Reads keys with $readKey, and places the gold with a random generator. The
// generator has a fixed seed, so the room is the same every time; start it
// with ($time)($newRandom) for a different room each run. The room is a flat
// array, read and written through getCell and setCell. Each turn clears the
// screen with an ANSI escape sequence and draws the room again.
//
// Arrow keys or w, a, s, d move; q or Escape quits.
//
// Usage: wvc build examples/walk.wvt, then run it in a terminal.

